<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak markets closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Slovak markets closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak capital markets are closed on Friday for the All Saints Day holiday and will re-open on Monday at regular times.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
